    <briefdescription>
<para>Transport layer of one ISO-TP connection: segmentation, flow control, timing. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A link connects this node to one peer: it sends with the CAN ID <ref refid="structisotp__link__config_1a5f835b27dee94549fb99e789fad073ee" kindref="member">isotp_link_config::tx_id</ref> and receives the frames the application routes to it (normally the frames with the peer&apos;s CAN ID). The link never reads a clock or touches hardware. The integrator passes every received CAN frame to <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gaae3f928524c58c8f770c792cfacbb0e1" kindref="member">isotp_link_receive</ref>, provides the frame writer <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gaca5ac2c2a69d9635bb30e83da20a3b82" kindref="member">isotp_can_write_fn</ref>, and calls <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga9dcb3f75843c4f1c43b16bfca38a0814" kindref="member">isotp_link_poll</ref> regularly; the current time in microseconds is an argument of every call.</para>
<para>Transmission and reception are independent (full duplex). A complete received message is delivered to <ref refid="structisotp__link__config_1aa3c392ddb6b4a31048dd8309c6f8e3d2" kindref="member">isotp_link_config::on_message</ref>; the end of a transmission is reported to <ref refid="structisotp__link__config_1a9cfc2126989afa5f4647514294ffebdc" kindref="member">isotp_link_config::on_tx_done</ref>.</para>
<para>A link is not thread-safe. Call <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gaae3f928524c58c8f770c792cfacbb0e1" kindref="member">isotp_link_receive</ref> and <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga9dcb3f75843c4f1c43b16bfca38a0814" kindref="member">isotp_link_poll</ref> from one context (for example a CAN task, not an interrupt handler) and serialize <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga2883f7405a37500b850b7d45b0367d51" kindref="member">isotp_link_send</ref> with them.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Public interface includes:</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Lifecycle: <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gadd4f1f0a9fde1d1b8d2f344bdc4381b8" kindref="member">isotp_link_config_default</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga9e8b1316e9e9aa54335beffb412e6957" kindref="member">isotp_link_init</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Message flow: <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gaae3f928524c58c8f770c792cfacbb0e1" kindref="member">isotp_link_receive</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga2883f7405a37500b850b7d45b0367d51" kindref="member">isotp_link_send</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gabf6b948e5e7c28312f610ab1ef0e1219" kindref="member">isotp_link_send_functional</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga9dcb3f75843c4f1c43b16bfca38a0814" kindref="member">isotp_link_poll</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Diagnostics: <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gad8b5a8280b3ce9cf2f05dda3c589fdf1" kindref="member">isotp_link_tx_busy</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gad0b919001194055a4b0f75f70ccc0f0f" kindref="member">isotp_link_tx_result</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga20e36e89c70a103d43cfa44131b92f95" kindref="member">isotp_link_rx_result</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga13d7e92afadcec1c4d9cf48b3c760303" kindref="member">isotp_link_invalid_frames</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
